      en: ["Over 500 stalls", "Area: 2 hectares", "Friday is main market day", "Up to 5,000 visitors on Fridays", "Covered market hall since 2005", "Cross-border trade with Mali"],
      es: ["Más de 500 puestos", "Superficie: 2 hectáreas", "Viernes es el día principal de mercado", "Hasta 5.000 visitantes los viernes", "Pabellón de mercado cubierto desde 2005", "Comercio transfronterizo con Mali"],
